{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"643b25481396b6256794fbd76101527d64a8e1f4b5531ffa2f528b943b613290","ja":"試合の興奮","zh":"比赛的兴奋","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ffd1b210e20f3c600509d2992331bf953796403b8c729505d27fe4e81a1d96fc","ja":"「決まった～～～～～！\n容赦ないジャンピング・ニー・バット～～～！」","zh":"决定了——！毫不留情的飞膝踢——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e0c8b0ba0871f43ebd3916f1a570208d6533db39fbc8476f171caf5b68592c4d","ja":"わあああああああ～～～～～～～っ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"55ea2277882f7e33b6827d5b9b61b2f1980e345044cd28e5986b7842769ae291","ja":"すごい！　あんな綺麗に決まるなんて……！\n今のは見てても気持ちいいわね！","zh":"好厉害！　竟然能那么漂亮地完成……！\n刚才那个看着也很舒服呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c9c45f1768bdb49bcde7fe9e0334054abc4119ac89a3b014bd26a9acdec8e3f4","ja":"でしょ！　でもこれで終わりじゃないよ！\nなんてったって今日のヒールは……。","zh":"对吧！不过这还没结束呢！\n毕竟今天的高跟鞋……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"77dc30ad21a988019ea56aa67a39411bc8c147b7b2b1dbb71e4387637388e1b3","ja":"「ヒャッハー！　こんなんで　ダーク闇堂様を\n倒せると思ったのかぁ！？　次はこっちの番だぜ！」","zh":"“呀哈哈！你以为凭这种程度\n就能打倒本大爷暗黑暗堂大人了吗！？接下来轮到我出招了！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8edca7d5530c81b47b823eeada35375bbdd19be950548b3035b81c05452271d7","ja":"ひゅ～♪　さすがねダーク闇堂！\nいけいけーっ！　ここから反撃よー！","zh":"咻～♪　真不愧是暗黑闇堂！\n上啊上啊——！　从这里开始反击——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9f725f090163e876971e68f11bad429a05f3f2b430bc1355bb4a5bd0b89de6a7","ja":"面白かった～！　ヒールの口上も最高で、\nすっごく集中して見入っちゃったわ♪","zh":"太有趣了～！反派的台词也最棒了，\n看得超级入迷了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ff177ced7360f376bcaa794c22d54890d429af3842bd8ebfe608214562e3b9a4","ja":"律子さんも楽しんでくれて、\n本当によかったよ～！","zh":"律子也玩得很开心，真是太好了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"742e56bd333bd84af43c84e4024008182b5c9042f19f7b4f8b63f5aa8d843d93","ja":"それにしても、後半の乱入タッグマッチ！\nあれはヤバかったよね！","zh":"不过，后半场的乱入双打比赛！那个真够劲的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b8c13d95bc3da82da7aa2154b7700c612da305bb869b123b24a67109b117aad8","ja":"ええ、本当に！　特に連携技が絶妙だったわよね～♪\nラストの決め技はちょっと攻めすぎかもって思うけど。","zh":"是啊，真的！尤其是连携技，简直绝妙呢～♪\n最后的决胜技可能有点太猛了，我觉得。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"12be3b2e8fc670bc4247c23eeccdb7286b413ac60b2d4086f2bb0927ec0043fa","ja":"え、そう？　あれくらい豪快な方が、\n盛り上がって面白いと思うけどな～。","zh":"咦，是吗？像那样豪爽一点的，\n我觉得会更热闹有趣呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1766.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5373b2235f898fc028b42db23d41d46a1219986ec8b0fbad3b15972e050352a2","ja":"あら、そうかしら？　私は……。","zh":"哎呀，是吗？　我……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
